---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'

const posts = [
  {
    n: '01',
    slug: '/writing/queue-isolation',
    title: 'Why I split Nura’s background jobs across two queues',
    thesis:
      'One queue is the obvious way to start, and it works right up until one kind of job jams and takes everything else down with it. Splitting them later is far more painful than splitting them early.',
    tradeoff:
      'You take on more moving parts and a recovery pass to babysit. In return, a failure stays where it happened.',
    system: 'session-analysis · insight-generation',
    read: '9 min',
    glyph: 'queues',
  },
  {
    n: '02',
    slug: '/writing/token-rotation',
    title: 'Rotating refresh tokens, and the day one shows up twice',
    thesis:
      'Most people rotate refresh tokens for basic hygiene. It turned out to be more useful than that. Once a token dies the moment it’s used, a token that shows up twice is telling you something, and you can act on it.',
    tradeoff:
      'Now and then you’ll log out a real user who did nothing wrong. That’s the price for making sure a stolen session can never hang around unnoticed.',
    system: 'JWT access · rotating refresh · Redis blacklist',
    read: '11 min',
    glyph: 'tokens',
  },
]
---

<Base title="Writing" description="Working notes on backend infrastructure for AI systems: how I isolate background jobs, and how I rotate auth tokens to catch a stolen session.">
  <section class="shell w-head">
    <p class="label">Writing</p>
    <h1 class="display w-title">Field notes from the layer<br />no one screenshots.</h1>
    <p class="w-intro measure">
      These are working notes on the decisions behind the infrastructure I build.
      I care more about why I made a call than the exact syntax, so there's no
      code here. I draw the mechanisms instead. Two posts to start. I'll add more
      when I've got something worth explaining.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="shell w-list">
    {posts.map((p) => (
      <a class="entry" href={p.slug}>
        <div class="entry__meta">
          <span class="label">Field note {p.n}</span>
          <span class="label entry__read">{p.read}</span>
        </div>

        <div class="entry__body">
          <h2 class="entry__title">{p.title}</h2>
          <p class="entry__thesis measure">{p.thesis}</p>

          <div class="entry__foot">
            <p class="entry__tradeoff">
              <span class="label">The trade-off</span>
              {p.tradeoff}
            </p>
            <p class="entry__system label">{p.system}</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="entry__glyph" aria-hidden="true">
          {p.glyph === 'queues' ? (
            <svg viewBox="0 0 132 84" class="glyph">
              <rect class="g-node" x="2" y="34" width="22" height="16" rx="2" />
              <line class="g-line g-live" x1="30" y1="26" x2="104" y2="26" />
              <line class="g-line g-dash" x1="30" y1="58" x2="104" y2="58" />
              <rect class="g-node" x="108" y="18" width="22" height="16" rx="2" />
              <rect class="g-node g-idle" x="108" y="50" width="22" height="16" rx="2" />
            </svg>
          ) : (
            <svg viewBox="0 0 132 84" class="glyph">
              <rect class="g-node g-idle" x="6" y="34" width="30" height="16" rx="2" />
              <rect class="g-node g-idle" x="51" y="34" width="30" height="16" rx="2" />
              <rect class="g-node" x="96" y="34" width="30" height="16" rx="2" />
              <line class="g-strike" x1="6" y1="42" x2="36" y2="42" />
              <line class="g-strike" x1="51" y1="42" x2="81" y2="42" />
            </svg>
          )}
        </div>

        <span class="entry__cta label" aria-hidden="true">Read →</span>
      </a>
    ))}
  </section>

  <section class="shell w-foot">
    <hr class="hr" />
    <p class="w-journal measure">
      This is more of a running journal than a publishing schedule. I write one
      up when a decision was interesting enough to be worth making, and worth
      explaining afterward.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .w-head { padding-top: clamp(2rem, 1.5rem + 3vw, 4rem); }
  .w-title {
    font-size: var(--step-3);
    line-height: 1.22;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    margin: 0.7rem 0 0;
  }
  .w-intro {
    margin-top: clamp(1.2rem, 0.8rem + 1.5vw, 1.8rem);
    color: var(--graphite);
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .w-list {
    margin-top: clamp(2.5rem, 1.5rem + 4vw, 4.5rem);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .entry {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    grid-template-areas:
      'meta glyph'
      'body glyph'
      'cta  glyph';
    gap: 0.4rem 2.5rem;
    align-items: start;
    padding: clamp(1.8rem, 1.2rem + 2vw, 3rem) clamp(1.2rem, 0.8rem + 1.5vw, 2rem);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);
    transition: background 200ms var(--ease), color 200ms var(--ease);
  }
  .entry:first-of-type { border-top: 0; }
  .entry:hover { background: var(--ink); color: var(--invert-fg); }
  .entry:hover .label { color: var(--invert-mute); }
  .entry:hover .entry__thesis,
  .entry:hover .entry__tradeoff { color: var(--invert-mute); }

  .entry__meta {
    grid-area: meta;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    max-width: 46ch;
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
  }
  .entry__read { color: var(--mute); }

  .entry__body { grid-area: body; }
  .entry__title {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    color: var(--ink);
    transition: color 200ms var(--ease);
  }
  .entry:hover .entry__title { color: var(--invert-fg); }
  .entry__thesis {
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--graphite);
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  .entry__foot {
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.8rem 2.5rem;
    align-items: baseline;
  }
  .entry__tradeoff {
    max-width: 52ch;
    color: var(--graphite);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .entry__tradeoff .label { display: block; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; color: var(--ink); }
  .entry:hover .entry__tradeoff .label { color: var(--paper); }
  .entry__system { color: var(--graphite); }

  .entry__cta {
    grid-area: cta;
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
    color: var(--graphite);
    transition: color 200ms var(--ease), transform 200ms var(--ease);
  }
  .entry:hover .entry__cta { color: var(--rust); transform: translateX(4px); }

  .entry__glyph {
    grid-area: glyph;
    align-self: center;
    width: clamp(110px, 12vw, 152px);
  }
  .glyph { width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .g-node { fill: none; stroke: var(--ink); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .g-node.g-idle { stroke: var(--rule); }
  .g-line { stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .g-live { stroke: var(--ink); }
  .g-dash { stroke: var(--rule); stroke-dasharray: 4 4; }
  .g-strike { stroke: var(--graphite); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .entry:hover .g-node,
  .entry:hover .g-live { stroke: var(--invert-fg); }
  .entry:hover .g-node.g-idle,
  .entry:hover .g-dash,
  .entry:hover .g-strike { stroke: var(--invert-rule); }

  .w-foot { margin-top: clamp(2.5rem, 1.5rem + 3vw, 4rem); }
  .w-journal {
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
    color: var(--graphite);
    font-size: var(--step-0);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  @media (max-width: 40rem) {
    .entry {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      grid-template-areas: 'meta' 'glyph' 'body' 'cta';
      gap: 0.4rem 0;
    }
    .entry__glyph { width: 120px; margin: 0.5rem 0 1.2rem; }
    .entry__meta { max-width: none; }
  }
</style>
